entries.en:
But it really is incredible. Not only can you put on a performance
for clients,
but you can even be possessed!

He said that if he looks
for a company, he'll pick a big one. But from my perspective,
I don't think he has a shot. So, I'd like your company to sort him out.

you immediately start looking
for something even more high-spec. But the Takarobo can never do anything,
so you never expect anything from it.
